  (e) verbs count — CLI surface vs docs claim

Exit 0 iff every dimension is green; exit 1 otherwise. Use this before
marking any top-level organ satisfied, and as a periodic substrate-health
check.

The verb does not invent verdicts. Each dimension reports green/red with
the load-bearing evidence; KEY 2 still belongs to the agent.
USAGE
        exit 0
        ;;
